 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board Publication
+
+Admins can publish a board to share it via a secret public URL. Unpublished boards have `public_url` set to `null`.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Only board administrators can publish a board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board payload, including a `public_url`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/abc123xyz",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. Only board administrators can unpublish a board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+### `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key`
+
+Returns a published board. This endpoint does not require authentication.
+
+### `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id`
+
+Returns a column on a published board. This endpoint does not require authentication.
+
+### `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:card_number`
+
+Returns a published card on a published board. This endpoint does not require authentication. Draft cards are not accessible.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
